{
  "id": "JHN.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 13",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu goohuun geeshanga ginealangaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea mii ghwahidu ghweelmeeda Basaaka nea ninal Yesu gideaba damandaanyi jea ghabeawa ng'eanyiida gawa heeda Bwaabwa nihidu, niny nea ghabwariiy fugaaschi mida jeeda ng'eanyiida, ea huumwa gil ghabwariiy ea ghwanaawda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda agiischooda bea shing'ada, nea abeeda ea niyiin meang'nyeandeenda jeeda Yudayda Iskariyote, was orjeeda Simon gichea ghwalaapta bwadaw niny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda Yesu ghwanal gideaba niyiin Bwaabwa geatingaaschi haleanjeeda sean, ea gideaba niny gwaleabu heeda ASEETA ak gaygabiikta heeda ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghang'eat aba heeda agiischeewa, ak ghaghatghat hang'weakaaschi ak gageanu hang'da mwanang' ak gwaradiischeewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu harakta ak ghwayiin beega, ak goohuun geeshanga giinealanga, ak goobuus aba hang'dida mwanang' radiischeewean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwahita heeda Simon Betaro; amahit gwayeesha Betaro niny, “Ng'utamiida gajahuuna geeshangeasu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i minali gideasinyi ghamneawa ak gaynala iidu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Betaro, “Ang'iing'i majahuuna geeshangeasu earahay.” Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha niny, “Iimeahuuni geeshangaagu ea meeguuyeeni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Simon Betaro, “Ng'utamiida, ada abeeda ea mii geeshangeasu gil ak ghwahit, eara geatingeasu ea uhuudeanyu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Siida iiniihuushi ea manda gichea goohuun geaghus geeshangaaschi, aba gideaba niimmiidu saseesean; agooga goowooschi miyaas, ak ea mii oogaseani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda niny ghwanal siida jea ghwala bwadaw; ak ghoah girukuna gideaba, “Agooga moowoosi miyaasiin oogasean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nea niihiit giihuunda geeshanga, nea nibiikta gookwa hang'weakaaschi, gabiikta goobideada aba heeda gwachi, ak gwayeesha saawa, “Noanali ng'asheanji easineegwean? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga googuureewanean Giinealshoocheanda ea Ng'utamiida; ak ghwadoabiiw, aba gideaba geawooschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aniini iyeawooschi Giinealshoocheanda ea Ng'utamiida ak gajoohuuna geeshangeagwa, asi gamiiseegwa eara agooga gideaba oohuuna geeshangeaba geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi neagoonyeegwa gichea agalana iissa abeeda eara agooga goosindi gidaghamneawa easindi aba heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineegwa, soomjeanda mii haweewa siidaanyi haw, ghana siida siicheakta mii haweewa siida ajeakta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iyoanali ng'asheesu abeeda ghang'wana iyoosinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meabaloolani badahuukeagwa oogasean; aniini ghaanali gea aaloachi; ak abeeda gwasa ng'ooruutka, ‘Siida ak mukaateeydeanyu niyam geaw ak ghwalaabwan bwadaw.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nearukuneegwa ng'asheesu ghamneawa nea mii gwasa, ama eaweeda seameewa abeeda ghoanali gideaba aniini niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineegwa, Siida deapta dea eajeagu abeeda ghwadeaptanaan aniini, nea siida deaptanaan aniini abeeda ghwadeapta dea ajeaknean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghwaramoar gichea ealaapta bwadaw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiit Yesu rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu gwasawana gurooroadaanyi, ak gamuuwu nea gwayi, “Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineegwa, siyagi aba jeedeang'wa gayghwalaabwan bwadaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goong'weersa geat giinealanga ak ea mwanala siida baloola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giinealaneanagi bwariiy Yesu abeeda ea neekeewa daghata Yesu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gageanu Simon Betaro ak ghaghoash giinealaneedida nea gwayeesha, “Heapi anyaasha gabaloola badaydeabeang'a.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiji duu gwadiiwa geaw giinealaneedida aba daghata Yesuun, ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida siida ng'eaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Niny siidida jea dang'uta murmurjeanda ak ghaadawjiini.” Ghang'uta murmurjeanda, ak ghoadaw Yuda orjeeda Simon Iskariyote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata ging'ooyda murmurjeanda ghoabita Shataani jeadaanyi. Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Gidida igasayi sinoodean lamwaja sina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ghanyea manda eara siyagi aba jeedeaba fugiga agiischiin dea jeeng'u gidarukusiina niny ng'asheandida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Yuda abeeda siida adiing'iida sandakwajeanda lapiya gil, hean ghaghay giinealanga mwaatkwa gili eesha Yesu, “Shaaha haleanjeeda sigasa eaweeda ghweelmeeda”; ghana gideaba gwayeesha adawa fuga barbari haleanjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata geandeayda murmurjeanda gwarita jarooda aba geeshangiga, nea damandida ea eawa gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Digheandeesh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghang'eat gawa, gwayi Yesu, “Asi ghamneawa Orjeeda Siida siikghaambiit ak eara ASEETA ea siikghaambiit aba jeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda iisiikghaambiit ASEETA aba jeadaanyi, abeeda gayghoaghaambiit niny aba jeadaanyi, ak gaybay ghoaghaambiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diibiga manang'i, aniini gajeendeayeena gil nuwaas. Gajagassean; ak gaydarukuneegwa gidaghayi earukusi fuga Yahudi, ‘Heedeawi aniini majoamuusa apkaani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geagonyeegwa diigheanda eesh, abwariinya geat, ak ghoabwariiydi geat gida aabwariiydaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gayghwanal buuneesean gideaba goowooschi giinealangeasu iyoobariinyayi geat agooga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghwaramoar sheang'da Betaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Simon Betaro niny, “Ng'utamiida, gigali yeenu?” Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Heedeawi majamuusa eani geeshteanyu ghamneawa; geaghus eani geeshteanyu iidu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Betaro niny, “Ng'utamiida, neada ghwasaan inyas maydaamu deadu geashtaang'u ghamneawa? Aniini gaydaghashta eaweegeasu aba badaydaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Gajaghaashta eaweagaagu aba badaydeanyu? Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineey, damanda miigooguula nghaghooda gajea nishaang'nyaan niba samwagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.13.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
